#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""ServiceTray for Linux: a tray monitor for local services, Docker containers, systemd units
and services on other machines. A port of the Windows/Xojo ServiceTray; same services.json
format, minus the WSL side.

  service-tray                 run in the tray
  service-tray --details       also open the details window
  service-tray --prefs         also open Preferences
  service-tray --check-ports   run the port check after 8 s (results in status.txt)
  service-tray --menu          pop the menu up after 6 s (for screenshots)
  service-tray --quit-after N  quit after N seconds (tests)

Config: ~/.config/service-tray/services.json (see services.example.json next to this file).
"""
